1
00:00:00,205 --> 00:00:03,475
(Penny:)I don't think I've eaten
that much in my entire life.

2
00:00:03,476 --> 00:00:06,706
(Howard:)It's why my people wandered
the desert for 40 years.

3
00:00:06,712 --> 00:00:09,312
(Howard:)Took that long to walk it off.

4
00:00:11,116 --> 00:00:13,146
(Sheldon:)You see, Penny, the Israelites
were in the desert...

5
00:00:13,152 --> 00:00:15,622
Shut up!

6
00:00:15,621 --> 00:00:18,621
(Ra:)So glad you two
are done fighting.

7
00:00:18,624 --> 00:00:23,224
(Leonard:)Right now, I'm just trying
to burp without throwing up.

8
00:00:23,229 --> 00:00:24,399
SHELDON:
Hang on.

9
00:00:24,396 --> 00:00:27,236
Physics Today
mentioned the paper.

10
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:28,433
(Stuart:)What'd they say?

11
00:00:28,434 --> 00:00:30,834
(Amy:)Who cares?
Did they mention Leonard?

12
00:00:30,836 --> 00:00:32,006
(Sheldon:)They did.

13
00:00:32,004 --> 00:00:33,434
ALL:
Yay.

14
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:38,210
(Bernadette:)Good news, I found more Tums.
ALL: Yay!

